  "body": "So I have the problem that my Nextcloud integration in the calendar isn't displaying all of my Nextcloud entries. And even if it is, it's not displaying them correctly, but this problem has already been covered in another post. So let's take May 29, 2025; you see three entries plus five. Seven entries were already there, and Test 02 was added after the Homarr Calendar Nextcloud integration was created. If we look at Homarr now, there's absolutely nothing for May 29, 2025. But if we look at May 4, 2025, at least Test 02 was transferred, but all the other seven entries are missing. So not all entries are transferred, and if they are, they're on the wrong date.\n\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/c62873fd-17ce-4ba4-9ac2-b47bdd29dfa8)\n\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/4e7251db-32e7-4191-a75f-716e9b5cf65e)\n\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/ac7ac448-34bb-4029-9c27-d83aaa6d6f3b)",
